        "heading": "Some games pass time.",
        "heading_italic": "Mahjong commands it.",
        "body_1": "The first time you sit at a Mahjong table, something shifts. The tiles demand your attention. The strategy requires your focus. The clack of the draw, the rhythm of the discard — it creates a container for presence that almost nothing else does.",
        "body_2": "Otto was built from that moment. Not to reinvent Mahjong — a game with deep Chinese roots and a rich American tradition deserves respect, not a rebrand — but to create a set worthy of how the game actually feels.",
